  "description": "Two-dimensional daily-mean fields from the CMEMS global ocean physics analysis and forecast (1/12 degree): mixed layer depth (mlotst), sea bottom temperature (tob) and salinity (sob), sea surface height (zos), sea floor pressure (pbo) and sea ice variables. The re-served time axis is irregular (about every 2-3 days), not monthly. Hosted on the USF IMaRS ERDDAP (https://erddap.marine.usf.edu/erddap) and re-served with CORS and Parquet by erddap.oceanmetrics.io, referenced in place for computing place statistics in the browser via griddap.parquet.",
